oatpp-ssdp
------------------------------------------
Oat++ extension module to work with SSDP protocol

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  liboatpp-ssdp1-1.3.0-1bl2
  liboatpp1-1.3.1-1bl2
  libstdc++6-14.4.0-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cmake-4.4.5-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-g++-14.4.0-1
  liboatpp-devel-1.3.1-1bl2
  ninja-1.13.2-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/oatpp/oatpp-ssdp

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/oatpp/oatpp-ssdp/archive/refs/tags/1.3.0.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack oatpp-ssdp-1.3.0-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./oatpp-ssdp-1.3.0-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/oatpp-ssdp-1.3.0-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/oatpp-ssdp-1.3.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/liboatpp-ssdp1-1.3.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/liboatpp-ssdp-devel-1.3.0-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(oatpp-ssdp)
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/oatpp-ssdp.README
  /usr/share/doc/oatpp-ssdp/LICENSE
  /usr/share/doc/oatpp-ssdp/README.md

(liboatpp-ssdp1)
  /usr/bin/cygoatpp-ssdp-1.dll

(liboatpp-ssdp-devel)
  /usr/include/oatpp-ssdp/oatpp-ssdp/SimpleSsdpUdpStreamProvider.hpp
  /usr/include/oatpp-ssdp/oatpp-ssdp/SimpleUdpStreamProvider.hpp
  /usr/include/oatpp-ssdp/oatpp-ssdp/SsdpMessage.hpp
  /usr/include/oatpp-ssdp/oatpp-ssdp/SsdpStreamHandler.hpp
  /usr/include/oatpp-ssdp/oatpp-ssdp/UdpStream.hpp
  /usr/lib/cmake/oatpp-ssdp/oatpp-ssdpConfig.cmake
  /usr/lib/cmake/oatpp-ssdp/oatpp-ssdpConfigVersion.cmake
  /usr/lib/cmake/oatpp-ssdp/oatpp-ssdpTargets-relwithdebinfo.cmake
  /usr/lib/cmake/oatpp-ssdp/oatpp-ssdpTargets.cmake
  /usr/lib/liboatpp-ssdp.dll.a

